         "Vampirism, while neither condemned nor condoned by
          the producers, is a fitting  allegory  utilized to
          demonstrate the daily conflict  each of us face in
          determining to act on behalf of the  individual or
          in light of a larger whole.  Our intent is  merely
          to creatively  model the structure of this dilemma
          while leaving interpretation, if  any, entirely to
          the participant."
                             --- RAYMOND INTERACTIVE THEATRE

